RC or PLC in Liberty County","/arc-plc/texas/liberty-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 49% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 56%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 155% of normal on the middle. Grid 11840 had its driest year in 2011 at 44% of normal.</p>"}
